<title>INDIA: India's RBI repos auctions calendar for February.</title>
<headline>India's RBI repos auctions calendar for February.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Tuesday announced schedule for repos auctions in February.</p>
<p>The repos auction will be open to parties holding SGL account and current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period   Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>February 1	 February 3	  4 days  February 7</p>
<p>February 6	 February 7	  4 days  February 11</p>
<p>February 8	 February 11	 3 days  February 14</p>
<p>February 13	February 14	 3 days  February 17</p>
<p>February 15	February 17	 3 days  February 20</p>
<p>February 19	February 20	 4 days  February 24</p>
<p>February 22	February 24	 3 days  February 27</p>
<p>February 26	February 27	 4 days  March 3</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
